WEBVTT

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:41.640
Hey! Don't!

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.660
Stop it, or
I'll get mad!

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:46.420
C'mere, Soichiro.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.740
So, when's Godai
comin' back, anyway...?

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.190
Godai? I dunno.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.780
The Manager said tomorrow.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.800
Tomorrow? That's dull.

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:01.580
Why?

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:07.890
I just get a little bummed out
when it's too quiet.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.090
He's back!

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.220
I have returned!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.230
Welcome home
Mister Yotsuya!

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.100
Speak of the devil.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.500
--A Happy New Year.
--A Happy New Year.

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.200
Let's get the drinkin' started!
Move it!

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:32.090
--I have no souvenirs--
--I know that!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.480
I wonder where he
came back FROM?

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:39.390
Here's a pass!

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:40.680
I'm open!

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.140
Pass! Pass!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.570
Did you know
about this, Kyoko?

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.660
I may not look the part, but l
played rugby in high school.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:57.330
--You can do it!
--Way to go!

00:02:59.040 --> 00:02:59.830
Almost there!

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:04.140
Check it out, Kyoko!
I'm a superstar!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.360
Hello?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.920
Oh, Godai!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.620
What? Two to
three more days?!

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.190
Things are getting
dragged out here.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.210
My folks
really missed me.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:58.350
All right. Take good
care of your family.

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.350
Who're these "folks
that missed you so much"?

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.430
It's not like I can
tell her the truth.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.920
Coward!

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:08.750
Be quiet.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:16.110
I can't let the
Manager see me like this.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.200
Got time?

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.460
Mind if we come in?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.430
Of course not.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:49.870
So what is it--?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:53.070
We thought Godai
was due back today.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:57.040
He just called. It seems
he may be a few days more.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.350
Here.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.730
You must miss 'im.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.650
You were alone together
on New Year's Eve--

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.730
Nothing happened.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.130
Don't just throw cold water
on our conversatlon.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.100
But--

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.330
He didn't take your hand?

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.540
No, I was surprised at how
pleasant an evening it was!

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.650
Thank god!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.680
If anything had happened,
it would've been part my fault.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.630
You shouldn't have worried.
It was a good set-up.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.340
What does that mean!?

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.340
But why is he
staying home so long?

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.600
Maybe the kid's
just feelin' homesick.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.750
N-Now what?

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.870
I guess his mommy beats out
the love-of-his-life.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.030
That again?

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:53.320
He really is just a kid.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.130
He's being a good son! He didn't
go back for summer vacation.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:05:59.970
Yeah. Maybe.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:04.900
Compared to last year, the
kid's really grown up a lot.

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.370
His body's filled out, too!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.650
He'll be
legal this year!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.710
At his sexual peak!

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.050
--Nothin' happened?
--Nothin' happened?

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:19.420
You never stop!

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.790
--Not even a kiss!?
--Not even a kiss!?

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:25.280
We did not!!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:50.350
I must tell you the truth.
I love Godai.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:54.280
No! Ms. Otonashi!

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:59.090
But since we've been apart,
I may give in to the loneliness!

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.520
Then give in!!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:11.750
Okay, I will!

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.100
M-Muh--

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:20.460
M-Manager!!

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.320
W-What was that for, Gramma?

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.820
Dreamin' about that
landlady again?

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.600
Am not!
Not at all!

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:42.740
''M-M-M-Manager!!''

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.470
C-C-Cut it out!

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.840
So when were you planning
to return to Tokyo, Yusaku?

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.780
I don't know.
I can't go like this.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.150
Will you be here
until the 15th?

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.090
Huh? Why?

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.050
You can leave after the
"coming-of-age" ceremony.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:07.140
I can't! This morning's dream
would come true by then.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:09.990
"M-M-M-Manager!!"

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.950
Stop that, Gramma!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:21.750
Ms. Otonashi!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.540
May I treat you to a cup
of tea on your way home?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.100
Okay--

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.970
Today's the 9th.
Godai may come back today.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:34.340
Just go!

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:38.140
Why not let the Coach
cheer you up a bit?

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:39.850
What are you implying?

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:41.430
What do you mean?

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:45.650
Godai's still away,
and she's so lonely.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:46.970
Really?

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.640
There you go again!

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.510
Maybe I'll come, after all.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.010
I'm not just pinch-hitting
for Godai, am I?

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.510
Honestly!
Now you're doing it!

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:03.730
Back to the country?

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.400
Must be nice
having a hometown.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.460
So you must be from Tokyo.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.980
Yep. And you?

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.710
I went from school to school
when my father was transfered.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.730
I can't call any one
place my "hometown."

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.710
Is it true, about
your being lonely?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.880
Since Godai is still away?

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.660
Don't take her seriously.
It's not funny.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.710
Is that so?
I'm glad.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:02.950
I'm home.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.360
He's not here yet?

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.890
Welcome back.
That was fast.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.780
Godai would be disappointed if
I wasn't here to greet him.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.020
Dumpin' the Coach
for Godai, huh?

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:29.430
It's my duty
as manager!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:34.390
Duty, huh? But if he was comin'
back, he'd call to say so.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.870
I guess you're right.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.400
Worried 'bout him, huh?

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:42.860
As his manager.

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:53.840
Thank you.

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:05.090
I'm whole again!

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:08.960
I'm fine! She can
see me like this!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.360
Time to call
the manager!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.060
Hey, Yusaku!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.700
Quit sittin' on yer butt all day!
Help out with the restaurant!

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:20.420
I-I was just--

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.070
Shut yer trap, get out there
and make deliveries!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:30.090
Damn! The old slave driver!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.770
And I had finally decided
to call the manager, too!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.310
Manager?

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.980
I'll see you tomorrow!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.420
I'm home, Kyoko!
I've kept you waiting so long.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.550
Godai! I was so lonely--

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:54.170
But I never gave in!

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:55.220
Kyoko--

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.470
Kyoko!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.580
Godai!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:21.200
I want to answeryou;

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:26.770
But I'm giving in to love.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.120
I'm heading out to
meet my vendors.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.940
Okay. Don't drink too much.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.120
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:12:59.700
Here.

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.070
What's the plan
for tomorrow?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.480
You goin' back?

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.350
It's nothing to laugh at!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.450
B-But your face--

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:22.980
Don't laugh!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.590
Awww, man--

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:34.180
S-So then
a-about tomorrow?

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.380
I can hardly go back
looking like this, can I?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.940
"M-M-M-Manager!!"

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:40.680
Right?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.620
What's the matter?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.470
It's just so boring.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.600
Why not go upstairs and have
a party, like you always do?

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.770
I just ain't motivated.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:12.180
Our enjoyment requires a
pinch of Young Godai's angst.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.540
Hello?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.970
Godai? When
will you be home?

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:31.190
Another two
or three days?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.540
Maybe another
three or four.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.630
I'll be back as soon as I can
but it's still too early to tell.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.950
T-That long?

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.600
Godai, is there
something I should know?

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.370
No! Not at all!
I just--

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.710
M-My folks just
won't let me go.

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:54.680
Nobody's holdin'
onto you!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.650
Manager!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.520
I said, Manager!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.720
Kozue?

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.160
You're miles away.
What's wrong?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:23.770
Nothing.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.030
Shopping?

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:27.110
Yeah.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.050
What's up with Godai?
He's still in his hometown.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.950
He's awwful! He promised to
take me to a movie on the 10th.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.620
You don't know
why, either?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:45.290
No, he called last night and
said something about his parents.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:48.690
Really?

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:55.500
I miss him.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.260
I'm home!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:20.350
Welcome back.

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:21.680
Is he back yet?

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.940
Not yet.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.220
H-How boring!

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.970
What IS he doing, anyway?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:46.850
It's cold--

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.170
The eleventh already--

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.310
What IS he
doing, anyway?

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.750
It's only the wind.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:58.380
W-What're you doing!?

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.120
Quit it!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:03.640
Stop it!

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.070
You're laying around the
house every single day!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.430
Go back to Tokyo!

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:11.600
You wanted me here
until the ceremony!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.180
Because I thought you'd
help out at the restaurant!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.550
You call
yourself a man!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.810
Staring at yourself in
the mirror all day--

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:21.480
I-I'm not carpet lint!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.130
Yusaku.

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.940
You haven't been
studying, either.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.940
Maybe we'll find ya a wife so
you can take over the business.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.760
No!
Absolutely not!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.860
Then go
back to Tokyo!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.890
But, I can't--

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:55.680
Godai is really, really late.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:59.360
Haven't classes
commenced already?

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.210
It's the 14th!

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:03.220
He's homesick, remember?

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.710
He is still a child, after all.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:10.150
"And he didn't go
home for summer vacation."

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.830
And what about:
"He's bein' a good son"?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.360
Did I ever say that?

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:22.340
He's so inconsiderate! I've
still got the rent to collect!

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.150
D'ya hear that?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.980
Rent's not due for
another ten days!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.240
She's just minutes
away from a scene!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:33.170
I feel we should not
provoke her at such a time.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.720
Keep your secret
conversations SECRET!?

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:39.210
Manager, you must smile!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.470
Life has its twists. And Godai
isn't the only fish in the sea.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:48.700
S-Stop talking like that! You make
it sound as if Godai and I are--

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:53.070
But you've been
so depressed lately.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:59.570
I-I am not depressed. I'm only
doing my duty as his manager!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.050
Hey, maybe that's Godai!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:04.960
Just the wind--

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.170
Shall we make cerrtain?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:07.920
Let's go!

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.540
Aren't you coming?

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.790
If it was him
he'd say "I'm home"!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.200
You are so stubborn!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:22.600
I knew it!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.220
Welcome back, Godai!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.430
Where have you been?

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:30.110
It's a long story--

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:31.900
H-He's home...

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:40.320
Manager, quick!
C'mere!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.510
No! I want to drop
off my luggage, first!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.940
What are you saying?
You want to see her, right?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.540
It doesn't matter!
I don't have to see her!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.880
W-What did he say!?

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:57.120
Come on, Manager,
Come on!

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:02.640
I'm busy right now.

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:06.100
Do it later.
Just come with me!

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.170
What is this?

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:08.710
Now, now, Godai

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:09.900
I don't wanna!

00:22:10.310 --> 00:22:11.240
See?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:17.210
H-Hi--

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:20.500
Does he think he looks
cool in those sunglasses?

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:22.990
With no further delay...

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:24.140
...the Main Event!

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:25.550
Come on!
Stop it!

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:28.530
I said stop!

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:32.020
A giant is crying!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:33.490
Gotcha!

00:22:49.350 --> 00:22:52.220
I knew I should've stayed
two or three more days.

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:55.570
Ah, joyous reunions!

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.890
Haven't seen the
Manager smilin' in days.

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:00.260
If you call that smiling.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:06.170
Let's go tie one on.

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:07.670
How I've waited!

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:24.040
Welcome home.

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:26.690
It's good to be back.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:52.000
Godai's been acting
strange lately...

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.750
He's avoiding me, and
I think he's hiding something!

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:56.400
Something's up.

00:23:57.050 --> 00:24:00.420
Next: ''Godai's Roommate!
The Cat Who Came to Ikkoku.''

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:03.100
You named a cat after me?

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:05.860
Quit yelling my name
all the time!
